{
 "caps": [
  {
   "t": 0.0,
   "text": "How many apps does it"
  },
  {
   "t": 1.22,
   "text": "take to run a creative agency?"
  },
  {
   "t": 3.78,
   "text": "Depends."
  },
  {
   "t": 4.2,
   "text": "What do you need to do?"
  },
  {
   "t": 5.96,
   "text": "Find clients."
  },
  {
   "t": 6.72,
   "text": "Manage projects."
  },
  {
   "t": 7.64,
   "text": "Talk to clients."
  },
  {
   "t": 8.62,
   "text": "Get designs approved."
  },
  {
   "t": 9.8,
   "text": "Chase payments."
  },
  {
   "t": 11.48,
   "text": "So... a lot of apps?"
  },
  {
   "t": 12.92,
   "text": "Way too many."
  },
  {
   "t": 14.64,
   "text": "Your leads are in a CRM."
  },
  {
   "t": 16.16,
   "text": "Your projects are in"
  },
  {
   "t": 16.96,
   "text": "a project management tool."
  },
  {
   "t": 18.66,
   "text": "Feedback lives in email"
  },
  {
   "t": 19.68,
   "text": "or a separate proofing app."
  },
  {
   "t": 21.56,
   "text": "Client conversations"
  },
  {
   "t": 22.16,
   "text": "are somewhere else."
  },
  {
   "t": 23.42,
   "text": "And proposals,"
  },
  {
   "t": 24.2,
   "text": "invoices and payments?"
  },
  {
   "t": 25.58,
   "text": "More tools."
  },
  {
   "t": 27.08,
   "text": "And none of them seem"
  },
  {
   "t": 27.86,
   "text": "to know what's happening"
  },
  {
   "t": 28.8,
   "text": "in the others."
  },
  {
   "t": 30.22,
   "text": "What if they"
  },
  {
   "t": 30.84,
   "text": "were all connected?"
  },
  {
   "t": 32.58,
   "text": "Meet Nodstage."
  },
  {
   "t": 33.88,
   "text": "One connected workspace"
  },
  {
   "t": 35.04,
   "text": "built around how"
  },
  {
   "t": 36.12,
   "text": "creative studios actually work."
  },
  {
   "t": 39.14,
   "text": "Start with your leads."
  },
  {
   "t": 40.62,
   "text": "Manage inquiries,"
  },
  {
   "t": 41.64,
   "text": "discovery calls,"
  },
  {
   "t": 42.68,
   "text": "follow-ups and proposals."
  },
  {
   "t": 44.28,
   "text": "When a deal is won,"
  },
  {
   "t": 45.24,
   "text": "turn it into a project."
  },
  {
   "t": 47.42,
   "text": "Manage projects, tasks,"
  },
  {
   "t": 49.18,
   "text": "deadlines and your team's workload."
  },
  {
   "t": 50.82,
   "text": "Give clients their"
  },
  {
   "t": 51.5,
   "text": "own branded portal."
  },
  {
   "t": 52.96,
   "text": "Share files and proofs,"
  },
  {
   "t": 54.2,
   "text": "collect visual feedback,"
  },
  {
   "t": 55.54,
   "text": "manage revisions"
  },
  {
   "t": 56.1,
   "text": "and get approvals."
  },
  {
   "t": 57.56,
   "text": "Keep conversations"
  },
  {
   "t": 58.78,
   "text": "and video messages together."
  },
  {
   "t": 60.78,
   "text": "Manage your calendar,"
  },
  {
   "t": 61.88,
   "text": "change orders,"
  },
  {
   "t": 62.62,
   "text": "invoices and payments."
  },
  {
   "t": 64.26,
   "text": "Automate repetitive work,"
  },
  {
   "t": 65.68,
   "text": "use intake forms and templates,"
  },
  {
   "t": 67.52,
   "text": "track performance"
  },
  {
   "t": 67.98,
   "text": "and request testimonials."
  },
  {
   "t": 70.48,
   "text": "So I don't need to"
  },
  {
   "t": 71.06,
   "text": "keep jumping between"
  },
  {
   "t": 71.92,
   "text": "all those tools?"
  },
  {
   "t": 73.82,
   "text": "That's the whole point."
  },
  {
   "t": 75.54,
   "text": "Less switching."
  },
  {
   "t": 76.5,
   "text": "Less chasing."
  },
  {
   "t": 77.56,
   "text": "One connected workflow."
  },
  {
   "t": 80.16,
   "text": "Nodstage is coming soon."
  },
  {
   "t": 81.86,
   "text": "Join the waitlist for early access."
  }
 ],
